-- CargoWise One DEVELOPER LICENCE UPDATE
--
-- This script is to be used to Update/Install the developer licences for multi-countries 
--
--
-- USAGE:
--
-- 1. 	Open this file in ISQL and change usage to the database you want to update
--	EG: 	USE OdysseyPersonal
--		GO
-- 2.   Update the "SET @INSTALL_XX = 1" variables to indicate whether you want a particular company 
--	installed or not. Setting the value to 1 indicates you want that company installed,
--	and conversely setting it to 0 means you do not want it installed
--	EG: SET @INSTALL_AE = 1 will install the company for United Arab Emirates
--
-- 3.	Run the script (F5)
--


-- CONFIGURATION
--
-- Set the values to 1 for the countries you want installed

